# include/

Project-shared headers.

- `wifi_config.h` — Hub WiFi credentials (`WIFI_SSID` / `WIFI_PASSWORD`) for the
  NTP/ESP-NOW link. This file is **gitignored** (see `.gitignore`); edit it with
  your own access-point credentials before flashing the Hub.

The protocol types and schedule model live in `lib/protocol/`, not here, so both
the Hub and Clip share a single copy.
